        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: E. Howard Hunt, Miguel Delibes\n- Roles: intelligence officer, writer, novelist, journalist, newspaper editor\n- Topics: Generation of '36\n\nFacts:\n- E. Howard Hunt was born on October 9, 1918.\n- Miguel Delibes Setién was born on October 17, 1920.\n- E. Howard Hunt, better known as E. Howard Hunt, was an American intelligence officer and writer.\n- Miguel Delibes Setién was a Spanish novelist, journalist, and newspaper editor associated with the Generation of '36 movement.\n- E. Howard Hunt died on January 23, 2007.\n- Miguel Delibes Setién died on March 12, 2010.",
